# 📖 REFERENCE — Artifact Types

> **Branch**: `go:/olym/k/cogninfer/reference/`
> **RRP**: `t:/gopia/olym/k/cogninfer/reference/artifact-types.ail`

---

## Particle Types (theo ha:/ha/rules/engine-build/partner-rrp.ail)

```yaml
particle_types:
  NAP:
    full_name: "Nano Artifact Particle"
    extensions: [".yaml", ".json", ".toml"]
    size_limit: "< 1KB"
    role: "Smallest configuration unit"
  MAP:
    full_name: "Media Artifact Particle"
    extensions: [".png", ".mp4", ".wav"]
    role: "Media asset"
  DAP:
    full_name: "Decoration Artifact Particle"
    extensions: [".css", ".theme"]
    role: "Decoration / theming"
  CAP:
    full_name: "Crystallized Artifact Particle"
    extensions: [".amo", ".wasm", ".so", ".rco", ".sio", ".ae", ".ase"]
    role: "Sealed executable artifact"
```

## CASL Ladder (Nano Scalization)

| Level | LOC | Functions | Deps | Actor | AFC ID |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| MIC | 5-20 | 1 | 0 | T3C | — |
| NAP | 30-120 | ≤5 | ≤3 | T3C | `EE.CC.RR.FF.nXX` |
| CAP | 150-1000 | 3-12 NAP | NAP | CTO | `EE.CC.RR.FF` |
| NEP | 1000-5000 | 3-15 CAP | CAP | CSA | — |
| ME | 5-20 NEP | — | NEP | CSA/Royal | — |
| SPACE | GitHub org | — | ME | CSO | — |

## Extension Table (CAP outputs)

| Extension | Vai trò | Target |
|---|---|---|
| `.wasm` | WebAssembly | Universal runtime |
| `.so` | Shared object (Linux) | Linux native |
| `.dll` | Dynamic link library (Windows) | Windows native |
| `.dylib` | Dynamic library (macOS) | macOS native |
| `.ae` | Artifact Executable | Cosda runtime |
| `.amo` | Actor Module Object | HA actor |
| `.cap` | Crystallized Artifact Particle | CAW output |
| `.rco` | Runtime Callable Object | RCO runtime |
| `.aso` | Authority Surface Object | AVS surface |
| `.sio` | Stream IO Object | Comet/HO |
| `.ase` | Authority Sealed Executable | Sealed bundle |
| `.exe` | Native executable | Platform native |
| `.a` | Static library | Build-time |

## Artifact Lifecycle

```text
MIC (5-20 LOC)
   ↓ split
NAP (30-120 LOC)
   ↓ promote via C-X-R
CAP (150-1000 LOC, sealed)
   ↓ compose
NEP (1000-5000 LOC)
   ↓ compose
ME (5-20 NEP)
   ↓ publish
SPACE (GitHub org)
```

